        ],
        "student_prefix_sha256": "447f444ec61799aad7298d95d9ff864c477324778052a282ed0031fc68ae5692",
        "target": "Given:\n- Jan can handle 20 claims.\n- John can handle 30% more claims than Jan.\n- Missy can handle 15 more claims than John.\n\nFirst, calculate how many claims John can handle:\n\\[ \\text{John's claims} = 20 + (0.30 \\times 20) = 20 + 6 = 26 \\]\n\nNext, calculate how many claims Missy can handle:\n\\[ \\text{Missy's claims} = 26 + 15 = 41 \\]\n\nSo, Missy can handle 41 claims.\n\nFINAL: 41",
